{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c0872de2573dd19be48cecfffd8fdd603b4e0d6184bd31439dc5e3670d3df675", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保。\n新しい衣装、よく似合ってるな。", "zh": "辛苦了，志保。\n新衣服很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "bc4d5fefe421c568f484753e7c7c5d21a354e8cf82b6e177ece544b2209b9ac9", "ja": "ありがとうございます。あまり着ないタイプの\n衣装なので少し心配でしたが……。安心しました。", "zh": "谢谢您。因为是平时不太常穿的类型，\n所以原本还有点担心……听到您这么说我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "d36b2b0bea40ffd10d02d4503f07e84868de83312440df01a6e65cd829a57ef3", "ja": "もしかして、こういう衣装を見たいと思う人って、\n意外と多かったりするんでしょうか？", "zh": "难道想看这种服装的人，\n意外地还挺多的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1003_p", "source_sha256": "48f30d5f796274fe1ddbad4793d2d1cb68d7635c7813fa8b7633736f20183467", "ja": "人数はわからないが……。普段と違う志保の姿が\n見られるのは、ファンの人達も嬉しいと思うよ。", "zh": "虽然不知道具体有多少人……不过，能看到与平时不同的志保，粉丝们应该也会很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "e9f2c17cec61a3e0869aa17af645a6965f33698d7622ff340f980e79b8758011", "ja": "そうですか……。実は、弟に「かわいいお洋服を着て」\nって、お願いされたことがあるんです。", "zh": "这样啊……其实，我弟弟曾经拜托我“穿上可爱的衣服”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "4fb52d9e352113c93cd1a75e484b3da831730fa5a110510cae76a0efe115e5ff", "ja": "似合うかわからないので、悩んでいたんですけど……。\n弟のほうが、見る目があるのかもしれません。", "zh": "我不知道合不合适，所以一直很苦恼……说不定还是弟弟更有眼光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1006_p", "source_sha256": "08266ee040ebb02d574fdc3881eec05a5cfccac0fd3140e7aefc82c3ccf5a812", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。\nさすが家族だ。志保のことを一番理解してるな！", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。果然是家人啊，最了解志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "3bdf703fd29fd38e3a484c9e86ea45d84a879c852d5143418b46c48ea9dd6927", "ja": "そう……ですね。\nあの、{$P$}さん。できたら……。", "zh": "嗯……是的。那个，{$P$}先生。如果可以的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c489de95d2e557d8dfcc4d20d49d756d73312d53a2669d0409d36097c0447040", "ja": "わかってるよ。ご家族を公演に呼びたいだろう？\n都合のいい日がわかったら教えてくれ。", "zh": "我明白。你想请家人来看演出对吧？\n要是知道了方便的日期就告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "e6b5f7b53bcbd98efe0cf128058e387bc4442da154a36966b0af52cbf5c3f74d", "ja": "……はい、ありがとうございます。\nきっとこの衣装を見たら、家族も喜ぶと思います。", "zh": "……好的，谢谢您。\n我想如果家人看到这身服装，肯定也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "4d37835626cc4151d5fbef8e3b2527bcb6cf7e617e71f46da8e491a25ec27f76", "ja": "まさか、こういう形で、弟のお願いを\n叶えてあげられるなんて思いませんでした。", "zh": "真没想到，能以这种形式\n来实现弟弟的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "25f20cab1ce889a50f7e13413f9de7fb05d8a32945c7cfbf7a757cbe25386080", "ja": "そうか。他にも力になれることがあれば、言ってくれ。\nできるだけ協力させてもらうよ。", "zh": "这样啊。要是还有什么我能帮上忙的，就尽管说。\n我会尽可能配合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "a1b66a4bdfa1cec839776b47cde9a21fc1718ec66de2ec8e27a61f76c3a454ae", "ja": "そうですか……。じゃあ、\n少し聞きたいことがあるんですけど、いいですか？", "zh": "这样啊……那么，\n我有点事情想问你，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2bca2ce3b071adc4d9a26ddbef6126353797a67a1400ae054357f69081a41b44", "ja": "もちろん！　聞きたいことってなんだ？", "zh": "当然！想问的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "06ebff0a318f35470b8f0f80e735ba017cc4a8be8e968c73e2f7dcd9a85eabbe", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\n私にお願いしたいことって、ありますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n您有什么想拜托我的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a7cedca18704dc68b927a4953a6fc9980cf4e018a00106aa6a284fab23634e47", "ja": "えっ？　お願い？", "zh": "咦？拜托我的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "c9a99c35a581e730b90beb6cd75f828d1974d6f819e704b27b12527924be7361", "ja": "例えば、弟みたいにかわいい洋服を着てほしいとか。\n私にできる範囲のものになりますけど……。", "zh": "比如，希望你穿上像弟弟一样可爱的衣服之类的。\n虽然只能是在我力所能及的范围内……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1017_p", "source_sha256": "648557cb15c6c4e71929106b591f374516c773ceb8586755621d0a2539145279", "ja": "うーん……志保が自分自身の考えを大事にしてくれれば\nそれでいいかな。他の誰でもない、志保のためにね。", "zh": "嗯……只要志保能珍视自己的想法，那就够了。不是为了别人，而是为了志保自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "5c36bb494145565d906a65da91edfbbb56ee0a78bb1440170ecd7ba7ba1f4012", "ja": "服の好みを聞いただけなんだけど……まったく。", "zh": "我只是问了一下你对衣服的喜好而已……真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "b82451f63ff60147075954dbc722aa994b1fcb883d6e04ae99bc80eab795118f", "ja": "それ、お願いでもなんでもないですよね？\nもういいです……質問が伝わらなかったみたいなので。", "zh": "那根本算不上什么拜托吧？\n算了……看来我的问题没能传达给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ea9b2795118fde73be28d6f4ae0d1ef448e6e90bcf74520feb61f4332e1547d0", "ja": "えっ、志保！？", "zh": "咦，志保！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0354_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "279bd81e4fc1e89f2b73824e67c0add87e57e0565525a16dc5069e145b002016", "ja": "またいつか聞きますから、考えておいてください。\nその時は、ちゃんと答えてくださいね。ふふっ。", "zh": "我改天还会再问您的，请您先好好考虑一下。\n到那个时候，可要认真回答我哦。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
